msgstr "emulator terminala"

#: kcontrol/componentchooser/componentservices/kcm_terminal.desktop:71
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid ""
"This service allows you to configure your default terminal emulator. All KDE "
"applications which invoke a terminal emulator application should honor this "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj servis omogućava da podesite podrazumijevani emulator terminala. Svi KDE "
"programi koji pozivaju terminal treba da poštuju ovu postavku."

